  "prefLabel": "App 102.06 Cancellation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "App 102.06 \"Cancellation\" means the termination of the registration or approval status of a program at the request of the sponsor or termination of an apprenticeship agreement at the request of the apprentice.\n\nSource. #6364-A, eff 10-29-96",
